    "raw_output": "```javascript\nexports.decodeHex = function(text) {\n  if (!text || typeof text !== 'string') {\n    return null;\n  }\n\n  const hexChars = text.match(/[\\da-fA-F]{2}/g) || [];\n  if (hexChars.length % 2 !== 0) {\n    return null;\n  }\n\n  const bytes = [];\n  for (let i = 0; i < hexChars.length; i += 2) {\n    const byte = parseInt(hexChars[i], 16) + parseInt(hexChars[i + 1], 16);\n    if (byte > 255) {\n      return null;\n    }\n    bytes.push(byte);\n  }\n\n  return bytes;\n};\n```<|im_end|>",
